# Dockworker Drone dying with no other creature of Bot1's: "target creature you control" has no legal target (CR 603.3d), so the
# trigger is removed from the stack without a target being asked for (refused) and Bot2's Ornithopter gets nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Pearl
Dockworker Drone
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Ornithopter
Flame Slash
Mountain x18

[Actions]
