Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dockworker Drone.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Flame Slash.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Dockworker Drone)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Target

